  "description": "Reviewed notification integration: shared entry wiring and optional pose-aware canvas mail compositing. No-mail renderer paths, source character atlases, state machines and gestures remain unchanged. Hashes normalize .webp to .png. BuddyExperience also adds the reviewed independent calendar prop; actor, motion, gesture and original artwork remain unchanged. Nine remaining Experience components add independent calendar entry and notice exclusivity; no original gesture, character, state machine, or animation modifications. v0.4.10 additionally reviews identical uniform-quota preview samples, rounding and selection in the legacy and native Battery, Beaver, Cultivation and Hamster Experience components; native notification/calendar integration remains unchanged. v0.5.3 reviews shared Codex quota display/details and awakened whole-character art/transformations for the six migrated pets, plus quota-label wrapping. Original interaction state machines, window gestures and source atlases remain unchanged. Regression coverage and native acceptance limits are recorded in docs/release-0.5.3.md. 2026-10-16 reviews the Tauri-only shared crescent toolbar migration: original handlers and full play menus retained, scene clearance adjusted, and Buddy container Esc/panel exclusivity fixed. See docs/design/pet-arc-toolbar/README.md and design-qa.md; OS and real-account verification are separate. 2026-10-23 / v0.5.6 reviews shared Codex dual-window readout wrappers and accessible quota labels for the six migrated renderers. Cloud fallback markup, interaction state machines, gestures and artwork remain unchanged. Dual-window browser evidence and native verification limits are recorded in docs/codex-quota.md.",
